    "content": "# Angular Interview Guide — Chunk 7: RxJS and API Integration\n\n- [61. What Is the Async Pipe, and Why Is It Useful?](061-async-pipe.md)\n- [62. How Do switchMap, mergeMap, concatMap, and exhaustMap Differ?](062-flattening-operators.md)\n- [63. How Do You Cache API Responses in Angular?](063-cache-api-responses.md)\n- [64. How Do You Cancel Stale API Calls in a Search Box?](064-cancel-stale-search-calls.md)\n- [65. How Do You Handle API Errors with RxJS?](065-handle-api-errors-rxjs.md)\n- [66. How Do You Handle Loading, Empty, and Error States from an API?](066-loading-empty-error-api-state.md)\n- [67. How Is an Observable Different from a Promise?](067-observable-vs-promise.md)\n- [68. What Is an Observable in Angular?](068-what-is-observable-angular.md)\n- [69. What Is subscribe?](069-what-is-subscribe.md)\n- [70. When Do You Need to Unsubscribe?](070-when-unsubscribe.md)\n"
